<Base
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="What APIA warrants about the data it publishes, and what it does not."
>
  <section class="wrap measure">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1>Disclaimer</h1>

    <p>
      APIA publishes information compiled from public records. We take care to be accurate,
      and we publish our sources and method so that our work can be checked independently.
    </p>
    <p>
      We do not warrant that everything published here is complete or free of error. Records
      held by parliaments, departments and other bodies may be amended, withdrawn or added to
      after we publish, and our figures reflect the record as we found it on the date stated.
    </p>
    <p>
      Where a figure matters to a decision you are making, check it against the source we
      link to. <strong>The source is authoritative; we are not.</strong>
    </p>
    <p>
      APIA does not provide legal, financial, medical or other professional advice, and
      nothing published here should be relied on as advice of any kind.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you believe something published here is wrong, write to
      {" "}<a href="mailto:info@apia.org.au?subject=correction">info@apia.org.au</a> with
      “correction” in the subject line. We would rather know.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
